nふるさと交流事業\n\nふるさと会参加者数\n\n総務部企画課\n\n42\n\n地域公共交通確保対策事業\n\n公共交通利用者数\n\n総務部企画課\n\n44\n\n住民活動支援事業\n\n自治会数\n\n民生部住民生活課\n\n46\n\n安全安心まちづくり事業\n\n交通事故件数（人身）\n\n民生部住民生活課\n\n47\n\n電算システム管理事業\n\nマイナンバーカードの保有率\n\n総務部総務課\n\n48\n\nエネルギー対策事業\n\n再生可能エネ","status":"available","textSha256":"f62a9a2bad6bae9b8dc59d8449d3c437397dfeed890bb668bee44a7d722a366a","truncated":true},"title":"content_20250904_151923.pdf","titleBasis":"inventory_title","url":"https://engaru.jp/common/img/content/content_20250904_151923.pdf","verification":{"basis":["公式ページの本文・参照関係を確認（原本バイトは未保存）"],"evaluationRelevance":"verified","evidenceSha256":null,"evidenceSourceId":null,"status":"verified"},"years":[]},{"acquisition":{"containerSha256":null,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-21T08:40:52.753Z","httpStatus":200,"inputStatus":"fetched","memberIndex":null,"memberPath":null,"method":"network","sourceSha256":"bfc793625072197a271fc05605a08e5f7c3d5dde13d08daba35779f5e5eb3ae7","state":"acquired"},"evaluationType":"business_project_evaluation","format":"html","id":"f4fa8a3e9a7895b28758a28a","navigationReview":{"checkedAt":"2026-10-12T09:59:13.708328+00:00","evidenceUrl":"https://engaru.jp/life/page.php?id=1366","method":"official_body_review","notes":"公式本文はR6決算から事業行政評価結果を含むと明示。R6 PDF277ページで行政評価対象事業・成果説明を確認。R7 PDFクリックはplatform_InternalError。 北海道の自治体名と公式自治体ドメインまたは中央省庁公開資料を照合。","originEvidenceUrl":null,"publisher":"遠軽町","rawArchiveState":"collected","yearNotes":"2024 / 2025。noteに対象年度・報告年度・期間の区別を記載。"},"role":"evaluation_landing_page","text":{"assetBytes":0,"assetPath":null,"assetSha256":null,"characters":0,"exportedCharacters":0,"extractionMethod":null,"inputTextSha256":"bfc793625072197a271fc05605a08e5f7c3d5dde13d08daba35779f5e5eb3ae7","label":"unstructured_source_text","preview":null,"status":"no_readable_text","textSha256":null,"truncated":false},"title":"歳入歳出決算に係る主要な施策の成果説明書","titleBasis":"inventory_title","url":"https://engaru.jp/life/page.php?id=1366","verification":{"basis":["公式ページの本文・参照関係を確認（原本バイトは未保存）"],"evaluationRelevance":"ve